<#-- Mantle's default acknowledgement of a request for quote made from mail (locked, F70; impl-sales P20 review): the organization's
     own text takes this one's place by SalesPolicy.rfqAcknowledgeTextLocation. It sees only its map: requestId (the reference) and
     sellerName. Nothing of the request (its subject, text or files) is echoed. -->
<p>${localize('Thank you for your request for a quote. We have received it and will reply to you.')}</p>
<p>${localize('Your reference is')} ${requestId}.</p>
<p>${localize('Kind regards')},<br>${sellerName}</p>
